  One feature I've wanted to have a long time:

  The ability to find out how much the shopkeeper wants for all the stuff
I'm carrying/have eaten etc.  To my knowledge there's no way of getting
that information - save for carefully counting each "For you, esteemed sir"-
message.

  It could, I suppose, be easily incorporated with the "$" command so that
if you're in a shop and you owe the shopkeeper some money it shows your
debt as well.  Or, if somebody wants a more elaborate scheme, the shopkeeper
could when #chatted to say something like "Manlobbi reminds you that you
haven't paid yet and that you owe him 567 zorkmids."

  Yes, yes, I know, only wimps pay the shopkeeper, but sometimes wimps
survive...
